{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"632dd4147026fa600518a3f00c24b6fa8a338b17185b54576ae9104ec0242142","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":15,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["关于摩押的预言"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["以下是关于摩押的预言：",{"text":"摩押的亚珥城必在一夜之间被摧毁，沦为废墟；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摩押的基珥城必在一夜之间被摧毁，沦为废墟。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摩押人上到神庙，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上到底本的丘坛痛哭。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们都剃光头发，刮掉胡须，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"为尼波和米底巴城哀号。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们身披麻衣走在街上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人们在房顶和广场上号啕大哭。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"希实本人和以利亚利人都在哭喊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"声音一直传到雅杂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此摩押的战士大声喊叫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"胆战心惊。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的心为摩押哀号。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的人民逃难到琐珥和伊基拉·施利施亚。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们上到鲁希斜坡，边走边哭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在去何罗念的路上因自己的毁灭而哀哭。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"宁林的河道干涸，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"青草枯萎，植被消失，毫无绿色。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，摩押人把自己积存的财物都运过柳树河。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摩押境内哀声四起，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"号啕声传到以基莲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"传到比珥·以琳。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"底门的河里流的都是血，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我还要降更多灾难给底门：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"狮子必吞噬逃出摩押的人和那里的余民。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"line_break"}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/15.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/16.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/14.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":9}